AcceptanceCriteria.Criterion:
Exit-code contract, driven both ways in `src/query/change.test.ts` with each exit read
directly: `find` empty prints a non-empty line and exits 0; `find` matched exits 0;
`show` of an absent `C-ID` exits non-zero with one actionable line and no stack trace;
an unreadable bundle exits non-zero, never 0. Discriminating negatives: a bundle with no
close-bound criterion prints an explicit empty state; a bundle with no `plan.xml`
reports scope absent; a bundle with no `Verdicts` section reports the tally absent.
